Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n2,"enter restaurant and ask for menu") -> action(n3,"check offers") -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n5,"order a salad") -> converge(c1) -> action(n6,"wait for order to arrive and enjoy salad and wine") -> action(n7,"ask if you would like dessert (tiramisu)") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n8,"order tiramisu") -> action(n10,"wait for tiramisu to be served and enjoy it") -> converge(c2) -> action(n11,"ask for the bill and pay it") -> action(n12,"leave the restaurant") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"enter restaurant and ask for menu") -> action(n3,"check offers") -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n5,"order a salad") -> converge(c1) -> action(n6,"wait for order to arrive and enjoy salad and wine") -> action(n7,"ask if you would like dessert (tiramisu)") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n9,"decline dessert") -> converge(c2) -> action(n11,"ask for the bill and pay it") -> action(n12,"leave the restaurant") -> end(e1)
